{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 12810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11810, "text": "Hello, sweetheart."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 16510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14990, "text": "I missed you today."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 18710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17110, "text": "Yeah, uh, well..."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 25190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18710, "text": "This"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 27130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25190, "text": "is helping."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 28910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27910, "text": "Christine,"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 31090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30090, "text": "we have to talk."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 36170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31150, "text": "Talk? Harry, we have to kiss. We have to\nkiss as if our lives depended on it."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 37290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36290, "text": "No, no, no, Christine."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 39580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38360, "text": "We really do have to talk."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 42740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40720, "text": "Okay. Then let's talk about these."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 46420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43580, "text": "Two tickets to the Chief Magistrate's\nCharity Mask Ball."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 49060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47120, "text": "Yeah. See you at eight? No."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 54320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50020, "text": "No? No, Christine, you know, I've done\nthis to women before."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 56480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55480, "text": "Done what?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 57880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56880, "text": "Led them on."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 63760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60220, "text": "Made them think there was a future for\nus."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 66160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64720, "text": "But I can't do that to you."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 68100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66700, "text": "I care about you too much."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 71740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68900, "text": "You care about me so much that you're\ndumping me?"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 73660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72260, "text": "Oh, I know it hurts now."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 77300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74800, "text": "But believe me, one day you're going to\nthank me."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 79760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77860, "text": "Well, why wait?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 81600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80340, "text": "Thank you, Harry Stone."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 87800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86000, "text": "Jean, I thought that was going to be\ntough."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 90760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89760, "text": "Christine?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 93740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92740, "text": "Christine?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 102860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101119, "text": "Christine! Oh, what a nightmare."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 153120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151020, "text": "You haven't seen Judge Willard's Vicki,\nhave you?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 158940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 157560, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 161720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160160, "text": "You know, the one under his robe."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 163640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 162200, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 167800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164420, "text": "You know that fake collar and tie so he\ncan wear T -shirts on hot nights?"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 170080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168300, "text": "Oh. No, I haven't. Why?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 172160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 170540, "text": "This cliff from his chambers."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 173680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172680, "text": "It's weird."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 177300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173820, "text": "Stuff's been missing from all the\ncourtrooms. Everything from pushpins to"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 178300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 177300, "text": "Judge's robes."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 183320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179080, "text": "It's like somebody's stolen a courtroom,\nbit by bit."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 186520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183620, "text": "The only thing missing from our\ncourtroom is Dan."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 189280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187320, "text": "He's really getting bold."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 195580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 190360, "text": "Oh, don't worry about Dan. He just needs\na little time to recover from the shock"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 198440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195580, "text": "of the devastating loss of the Phil\nFoundation at the hands of Phil's"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 199440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198440, "text": "unscrupulous brother, Will."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 203680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201380, "text": "But once he does, he'll be hunky -dory.\nBye."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 213200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206740, "text": "So I... Obviously, Your Honor, this\nmenace to society is guilty,"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 218780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213580, "text": "guilty, guilty, and should be removed\nfrom the streets."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 227360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222580, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor, Father Fitzgerald is\nguilty of jaywalking that doesn't make"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 228660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227360, "text": "a menace to society."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 231100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228980, "text": "$50 and time served."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 234240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231620, "text": "Yet another win for the prosecution!"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 238180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236840, "text": "shooting fish in a barrel."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 242080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238940, "text": "You know, Oscar, there's nothing worse\nin this world than a poor winner."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 247320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242400, "text": "Oh, is that right? Miss look down your\nnose at the replacement DA."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 254140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249100, "text": "Nothing worse. Did you ever have Chinese\nfood in Bismarck, North Dakota?"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 257399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256399, "text": "I have."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 262200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260959, "text": "Oscar's giving me the creep."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 265420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262560, "text": "He gives me the crawls. He gives me the\nleft bones."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 267860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266700, "text": "Oscar the grouch?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 272280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268360, "text": "I can't help it. When he squints and\nshouts, I get hot."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 278380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274740, "text": "I know love is blind, but since when did\nit become deaf and dumb?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 282080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280340, "text": "I really miss Dan."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 287500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 283640, "text": "Yeah, well, if you promise not to spread\nit around, so do I."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 290580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289520, "text": "How about you, Your Honor?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 293430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292430, "text": "How about me what?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 295150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294090, "text": "How about you anything?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 296590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295590, "text": "Hello?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 299350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298130, "text": "I'd say we have a lot of work to do."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 304450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301250, "text": "Sir, I'd like to request a recess. We\nneed to talk. Can we go to your"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 308090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305730, "text": "Miss Sullivan, anything you have to say\nto me, you can say right out here at the"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 309090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308090, "text": "bench."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 311550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310550, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 314150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311950, "text": "Three weeks ago tonight, we kissed in\nCentral Park."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 318610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315870, "text": "Would you mind keeping your voice down a\nlittle bit?"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 323300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320620, "text": "Say a word to me. You can't even look me\nin the eye. Of course I can."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 329020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327600, "text": "That's lunch. One hour."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 336520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332380, "text": "What are you staring at? Do you have\nlunch plans?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 339400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337340, "text": "Of course I have lunch plans."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 346060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339620, "text": "I plan on eating a sardine sandwich out\non the loading dock and soaking in some"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 347060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346060, "text": "verbal abuse."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 353570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352010, "text": "Is this some kind of perverse joke?"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 357870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354510, "text": "Who put you up to this? Blondie? She\nhates me."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 359470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358170, "text": "But then who doesn't?"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 361650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360550, "text": "I don't."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 364410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362390, "text": "Well, all right. You can tag along."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 367010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364810, "text": "But don't talk. You might interrupt me."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 378630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375150, "text": "Sorry, Christina. I'm going to work\nthrough lunch. Got a lot of work. Work,"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 379670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 378670, "text": "work, work."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 381190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380190, "text": "Sure, it's me."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 383290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382190, "text": "Mac, thank goodness. Come on in."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 386970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383910, "text": "Got something on your mind, Harry? Oh,\nboy, do I ever."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 392170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389110, "text": "Mac, it's parable time."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 395750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392430, "text": "Oh, good. Hey, I love your parables."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 400690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396810, "text": "Mac, once upon a time, there was this\nlittle parakeet."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 402690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401010, "text": "Happy, content little parakeet."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 405070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402930, "text": "Okay, a happy parakeet. Gotcha."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 409630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405870, "text": "See, this parakeet, he'd known this\ncanary for a long time."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 414770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410250, "text": "And one night, the parakeet was just\nflying through Central Park, and he"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 420670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 414770, "text": "accidentally, on purpose, ran into the\ncanary and her ex -husband."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 428670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422730, "text": "And? The next thing he knew, the\nparakeet and the canary, they were"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 432690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430610, "text": "And then they went back to her perch,\nhuh?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 436810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434970, "text": "No, they just went to their separate\ncages."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 440380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437560, "text": "Well, that's a pretty uneventful little\nparable, Harry."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 441940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440940, "text": "No, Mac!"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 445600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442020, "text": "Mac! See, don't you get it? The canary,\nthat's Christine."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 447860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 445880, "text": "And the parrot, that's me."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 450000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449000, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 452840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450260, "text": "Don't patronize me in my moment of\ntorment."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 458960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453640, "text": "Mac, I'm telling you, Christine is head\nover heels in love with me."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 460580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459580, "text": "And you?"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 463240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460760, "text": "Well, I love her, of course, but I'm\nnot..."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 468100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463680, "text": "In love with her. Oh, and you are\npositive now that she's in love with"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 471240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468100, "text": "are you kidding? That woman went off\nlike a volcano when I kissed her."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 474380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472280, "text": "Of course, I have that effect on women."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 477320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476320, "text": "Curse."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 481500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478060, "text": "Well, it seems that since you're both\nadults, it should be easy to work out."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 485920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481820, "text": "No, Mac, I'm talking about a woman who\nis desperately in love. Oh, so the"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 487800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485920, "text": "solution is to avoid her for the rest of\nyour life?"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 489379, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488380, "text": "Guess so."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 491680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489380, "text": "Unless somebody with a better idea comes\nthrough the door."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 498120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496720, "text": "I was talking about the other door."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 501620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498780, "text": "Excuse me, Harry, but there's a guy with\na gun here to see you."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 503080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502080, "text": "Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 504540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503540, "text": "Frank Pepitone."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 506740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504980, "text": "Harry, we have to talk."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 508740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507020, "text": "After the guy with the gun, doll."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 512980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509960, "text": "As I was saying, Frank Pepitone, DA\ninvestigator."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 515360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513700, "text": "I'm working on the fielding\ndisappearance."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 517880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516080, "text": "Oh, don't bother. He's already\ndisappeared."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 524220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522340, "text": "I know Dan, and he'll be back."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 528000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524720, "text": "Good. Because I got a little surprise\nfor him."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 530960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529220, "text": "A warrant for his arrest?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 532860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531860, "text": "What's the charge?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 538260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533260, "text": "Embezzlement, fraud, and grand larceny\nto the sweet tune of 10 .2 mil."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 541320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538860, "text": "Hey, Dan had nothing to do with that."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 544640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541620, "text": "He was the victim. He got ripped off by\nWill Sanders."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 547180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545660, "text": "Cool down, cue ball."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 552860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548760, "text": "I happen to have a warrant for Sanders'\narrest, too. It's a nice little scam"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 553860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552860, "text": "they pulled."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 555470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554250, "text": "What you talking about, Pipitone?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 559570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557530, "text": "Sanders pulls all the money out of the\nPhil Foundation."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 562110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559870, "text": "Then he and Fielding take a powder."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 565290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563550, "text": "He probably thinks he's gotten away with\nit."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 567950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566650, "text": "But we'll sniff him out."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 570870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568690, "text": "Just follow your nose to the cheap\ncologne."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 573350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572050, "text": "Thanks for the tip, sweetheart."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 577550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575990, "text": "You guys don't believe him, do you?"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 581110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579450, "text": "Dan's not a sinner. He's a saint."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 582910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581810, "text": "He's more than a saint."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 584950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583950, "text": "He's an angel."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 586510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585370, "text": "No, he's an archangel."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 589150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588050, "text": "No, he's a demigod."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 591970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590970, "text": "Right?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 597970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594910, "text": "You know, you doubting Thomases are\nreally starting to tick me off."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 604050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600790, "text": "Now, if you'll excuse me, I've got some\ngood will to spread."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 608670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606230, "text": "Well, I hope he turns himself in before\nthe cops find him."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 619750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612750, "text": "yeah poor Dan I'm gonna"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 621850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619750, "text": "go worry about Dan somewhere else"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 646200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645200, "text": "Poor Dan."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 649160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647000, "text": "Most of his friends think he's guilty."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 654820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651540, "text": "What am I laughing at? I'm Dan."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 658800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657320, "text": "No, I'm not."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 665320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659540, "text": "Now, I am the phantom of the courthouse."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 674840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669720, "text": "And no, Inspector Pepitone, You will not\nbring Dan Fielding to justice because"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 677720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674840, "text": "there is no justice in this building."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 681660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680580, "text": "Not yet, anyway."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 684420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682540, "text": "But soon I will remedy that."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 691940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684940, "text": "I will vanquish the guilty. I will\npunish the wicked. I will take the"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 693020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691940, "text": "stapler because I need one."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 705240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701740, "text": "Because the phantom's lair is short on\nhalf and half."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 712300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707500, "text": "Now I must prepare, because my time is\nnear."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 715940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712580, "text": "The time of the phantom."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 718120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717120, "text": "Ouch!"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 722680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720180, "text": "The phantom banged his shin."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 728060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 725100, "text": "I'll have to take that out on someone."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 740110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736330, "text": "Last case of the night coming up, sir.\nPeople versus Rona Ornstein."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 741430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740430, "text": "Solicitation."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 743110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742110, "text": "Prosecution."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 744630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743370, "text": "She's a hooker."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 749030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747050, "text": "Hooking is against the law."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 752590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750350, "text": "The prosecution rests."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 762990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758210, "text": "Confess. My client pleads guilty and\nthrows herself on the mercy of the"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 764450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762990, "text": "object. To what?"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 766000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764940, "text": "The mercy of the court?"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 769000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766220, "text": "No. To what's coming up next."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 772500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770400, "text": "$50 and time served."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 776480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772820, "text": "It's always $50 and time served."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 783120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777400, "text": "Just to break up the monotony of the\ncourtroom, the people moved that the"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 789700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783120, "text": "sentence be $55 and time served."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 792720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790940, "text": "Objection. I knew it."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 796850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795850, "text": "It's punitive, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 800890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797210, "text": "Well, punishment is the objective, isn't\nit, Miss Sullivan? And since the"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 805750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800890, "text": "prosecution seems willing to make an\nunprecedented stink over this, why don't"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 809470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 805750, "text": "split the difference and make the fine\n$52 .50 in time?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 814190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811690, "text": "$52 .50. The end of an era."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 817610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815110, "text": "I know. It's a shock to my system, too."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 819030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818030, "text": "Let's go lie down."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 823230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821050, "text": "And that's a wrap, folks. Good night."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 824530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823490, "text": "Not so fast, sir."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 826920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825040, "text": "Harry, you have to talk."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 831660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827160, "text": "Well, I'm... Fine."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 834000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832540, "text": "How about in my chambers?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 840180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838280, "text": "Hey, Oscar."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 841740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840620, "text": "Where are you going?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 844000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842560, "text": "Well, let's see."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 845900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844260, "text": "The night's still young."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 852680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846140, "text": "I figure I'll stop at the corner, pick\nup a kraut dog and a papaya juice, head"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 858610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852680, "text": "down to my place, do the... TV guy\ncrossword puzzle and fall asleep in my"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 859610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858610, "text": "clothes."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 862790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860910, "text": "You could do that at my place."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 867890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863830, "text": "Do you have one of those foot massage\nmachines?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 872530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869030, "text": "No. But I'll let you stand on my\nepileptic cat."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 887580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882920, "text": "looks like the beginning of a not\ncompletely horrible and humiliating"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 888580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887580, "text": "relationship."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 891500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890400, "text": "Cream? Sure."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 897300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894800, "text": "Well, that's strange. I could have sworn\nI had a quart of half and half."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 901140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899000, "text": "I'll just run down to the corner and\npick some up."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 902360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901360, "text": "Harry!"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 906800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903500, "text": "You've been avoiding me since that night\nin the park. You know it and I know it."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 911140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907760, "text": "We've had one kind of relationship for\nseven years. Have I ever shown you my"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 911959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911140, "text": "moon rock?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 912960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911960, "text": "Yes, you have."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 918940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915240, "text": "When two people have known each other as\nlong as we have, sometimes, well,"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 920060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919060, "text": "feelings change."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 923320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921260, "text": "Love is a very strange thing, you know."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 926140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925140, "text": "Yeah, I know."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 934180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927260, "text": "And the truth is... The truth is I'm\nglad we had this little talk."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 938620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936200, "text": "Harry, your two tickets to the\ncourthouse mass ball just arrived."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 940600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939600, "text": "Whoops."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 949620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944100, "text": "So you want to go?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 951020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950020, "text": "Oh, I'd love to."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 952840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951840, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 954140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953140, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 961640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958740, "text": "Well, Mac, thanks to you, now we're\ndating."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 966450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965450, "text": "Did you straighten everything out?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 968810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966570, "text": "Oh, Roz, it's worse than I thought."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 971670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969670, "text": "Harry is head over heels in love with\nme."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 975710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973150, "text": "I don't know where I'm going to find a\ngown by tomorrow night."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 977470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976470, "text": "A gown?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 978510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977510, "text": "Tomorrow night?"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 980130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978670, "text": "What the hell went on in there?"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 993150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 991910, "text": "Hey, loosen the screw."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 995930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993910, "text": "Bye. a loosened screw."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1000130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998110, "text": "My preparations are complete."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1005170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000590, "text": "This courtroom which has been witness to\nmy many victories will tomorrow night"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1007510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005170, "text": "see my greatest triumph."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1031630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030510, "text": "like Cinderella at the ball."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1033810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1032650, "text": "Somebody pinch me."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1048510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041810, "text": "And I'm going to keep on working"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1053370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048510, "text": "24 hours a day, seven days a week until\nFielding is behind bars where he"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1054370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053370, "text": "belongs."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1062100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061100, "text": "aren't as noticeable."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1069880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066700, "text": "Hey, get your hands off my girlfriend."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1071480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070320, "text": "What are you, a creep?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1077700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072940, "text": "No, just a man taken for the moment by\nbeauty and compassion."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1080520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078260, "text": "Oh, yeah? Well, get your own chicks."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1082820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080860, "text": "I'm more than man enough for her."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1087780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083300, "text": "But she speaks the truth, you twisted\nlittle pipsqueak."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1091420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089240, "text": "I, too, knew Dan. Fielding."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1093580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092160, "text": "He was my idol."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1095240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094240, "text": "Fielding, an idol?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1099540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095660, "text": "That man is the lowest form of life on\nEarth."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1104500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101220, "text": "You're taking this Fielding thing a\nlittle personally, aren't you, Inspector"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1106040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104500, "text": "Peppertone?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1110240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107940, "text": "You have an unfair advantage, stranger."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1113760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111060, "text": "You know my name. I don't know yours."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1118880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114360, "text": "The name's... Phantom."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1122420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121220, "text": "Phantom? Well,"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1124280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123280, "text": "Phantom."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1126780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125060, "text": "Jean -Claude Phantom."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1130000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128940, "text": "I'm French."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1132340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130960, "text": "On my mother's side."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1137560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133180, "text": "Well, what makes you think this fielding\nthing is personal, Phantom?"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1143320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138400, "text": "Because three years ago, the night\nbefore your wedding, he deflowered your"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1144320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143320, "text": "fiancée."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1147600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146360, "text": "How do you know that?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1149420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148240, "text": "Well, the news."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1151900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149800, "text": "It was all over, Fran."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1156620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154080, "text": "If you'll excuse me now, it's time to\nattack the shrimp."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1160860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156940, "text": "I meant the appetizer, nitwit."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1176880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175460, "text": "The lovely Christine."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1187750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180970, "text": "begins to fall in place, the time of the\nphantom"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1189190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187750, "text": "is here."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1192830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190770, "text": "You know what I always say, Christine?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1195670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193230, "text": "Honesty is the only policy."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1199030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196470, "text": "Correctamundo. Yep. Yep. Yep. Yep."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1204570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199730, "text": "You know, I've always said that honesty\nis like shellfish."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1206670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205250, "text": "I smell shellfish."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1210170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209030, "text": "You know, I do too."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1214700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211340, "text": "Well, isn't that something? We both\nsmell shellfish."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1217340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214900, "text": "Well, I'd say that that's a special\nmoment."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1218660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217560, "text": "Yeah? Yeah."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1225540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221040, "text": "Oh, Harry, it's time to be honest. Come\non. This tap dance is killing me."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1229060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228060, "text": "Me too."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1233580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229200, "text": "The truth is, Christine, I love you. And\nI love you."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1240820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236100, "text": "Listen to me and listen well, denizens\nof the upper world."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1246580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245580, "text": "Photos."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1283120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282120, "text": "made this man's nightmare."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1287500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286500, "text": "Christine?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1289500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288500, "text": "Christine!"}
